      "id": "claim_0195b2995a714d15a9290ce58a759aff",
      "statement": "ACP exposes `rung-agent` over stdio with `--acp` and over an explicitly experimental Streamable HTTP `/acp` listener with `--acp-http`; `--acp-token` configures bearer authorization for the built-in HTTP listener.",
