      "id": "claim_2eb4292f2fe64f44b164800fa25335f6",
      "statement": "Default ACP stdio uses a parent proxy and detached worker per session; it routes session messages and notifications verbatim, resumes a session from its file after a worker death, and applies bounded exponential restart backoff, while `RUNG_ACP_WORKERS=0` disables this isolation.",
